Death comes for us all eventually. The longer you live, the closer you
get. Cherish it, plan for it. Do not waste it whatever you do!

This is not related to torrenting, but it is something I created and I
wanted to share it with you.

Be warned, this site assumes you believe the Bible to be true, factual,
and that you should act on that information.

If you do not believe these things I think the site could still be of
use to you, but be warned the picture it paints is sobering.

